        <div class="odoo-why-grid">
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Inventory Management</h3>
            <p>Real-time stock tracking across stores and central warehouses with automated barcode scanning and low-stock reorder triggers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"></line></svg></div>
            <h3>Point of Sale (POS)</h3>
            <p>Lightning-fast cloud and offline POS terminal engineered for high-concurrency barcode billing, receipts, and split payments.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Omnichannel Commerce</h3>
            <p>Unify physical store POS terminals with Shopify, WooCommerce, and mobile apps into one live inventory database.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l8-4v18M13 11h8v10H13z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Warehouse Management (WMS)</h3>
            <p>Multi-location stock transfers, bin location tracking, pick-pack-ship automation, and stock aging analytics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Customer Loyalty & Rewards</h3>
            <p>Reward repeat buyers with automated points accumulation, tier levels, digital gift cards, and targeted SMS/email offers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
            <h3>Business Analytics & BI</h3>
            <p>Real-time executive dashboards highlighting gross margins, top-selling SKUs, store profitability, and cashier performance.</p>
