            <h3>Purchase Management</h3>
            <p>Automate vendor POs, RFQs, cost comparison, and automated reordering based on historical sales velocity.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="odoo-why-card">
            <div class="why-icon-box"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B55D9" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div>
