              <h3>AI Automated Workflows</h3>
              <p>Predictive stock forecasting and automated replenishment purchase orders.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card wide">
            <div>
              <div class="glass-icon" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">🌐</div>
              <h3>eCommerce Integration</h3>
              <p>Sync inventory, orders, and customer accounts automatically with Shopify, WooCommerce, or custom web portals.</p>
            </div>
