          <div class="bento-card">
            <div>
              <div class="glass-icon" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">🎁</div>
              <h3>Loyalty & Gift Cards</h3>
              <p>Increase repeat orders with tier-based rewards and digital vouchers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card">
            <div>
              <div class="glass-icon" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">🏭</div>
              <h3>Warehouse WMS</h3>
              <p>Optimize pick-pack-ship routines and multi-bin storage management.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card">
            <div>
              <div class="glass-icon" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">📈</div>
              <h3>Financial Accounting</h3>
              <p>Automated journal entries, tax calculations, and double-entry P&L reports.</p>
            </div>
