    {/* SECTION 5 — WHO IS IT FOR */}
    <section class="odoo-section home-alt-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="odoo-section-header">
          <p class="odoo-section-eyebrow">Tailored Verticals</p>
          <h2 class="odoo-section-title">Designed for Every Retail Sector</h2>
          <p class="odoo-section-desc">Hegrix Retail360 includes specialized modules optimized for your specific retail niche.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="odoo-industries-grid">
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Fashion Retail</h3><p>Manage size, color, and style variant matrices with automated seasonal stock planning.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Supermarkets & Grocery</h3><p>High-volume barcode POS billing, weighing scale integration, and batch expiration tracking.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Electronics Stores</h3><p>Serial number tracking, warranty management, repair ticketing, and trade-in pricing.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Furniture Stores</h3><p>Custom order tracking, delivery scheduling, deposit billing, and assembly management.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Pharmacies</h3><p>Batch tracking, prescription validation, unit-of-measure conversions, and expiration alerts.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Luxury Brands</h3><p>VIP clienteling, serialized authenticity tracking, and white-glove customer care.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Sports Stores</h3><p>Variant management, equipment rental workflows, and seasonal inventory clearance.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Cosmetics & Beauty</h3><p>Shade matrix tracking, bundle kits, expiration monitoring, and loyalty promotions.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Jewelry Stores</h3><p>Carat/weight metal tracking, custom appraisal certificates, and vault security stock sync.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Book Stores</h3><p>ISBN barcode lookup, author/genre cataloging, and special customer pre-orders.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Wholesale Retail</h3><p>B2B buyer pricing tiers, matrix quoting, volume discounts, and credit limits.</p></div>
          <div class="odoo-ind-card"><h3>Department Stores</h3><p>Multi-concession tracking, inter-department transfers, and consolidated cashier closing.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
